{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id233658302"}, "name":{"label":"Nguyen Ken"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-07-27T04:01:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.6"}, "id":{"label":"1035757926"}, "title":{"label":"Too Bad, Please bring Foursquare back !"}, "content":{"label":"I agree with Vinh Tran. Please bring Foursquare and check-in funtion back into Foursquare. If not, i feel regret to say \"Goodbye\" to Swarm. :) \nI love the old days when using Foursquare. Now, feeling so annoyed about this App. \nLast few weeks, when tapping to Check in on Foursquare, it's opens up Swarm. But now, it's \"Check-in\" funtion had been almost moved to Swarm. So dissapointed about this !", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=870161082&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id222631776"}, "name":{"label":"Vinh Snow Flake"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2014-07-24T00:04:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.6"}, "id":{"label":"1033997883"}, "title":{"label":"Swarm with out-up-date functions"}, "content":{"label":"Hi,\nMy name Vinh Tran from Viet Nam. I like your Foursquare from old days. Now I am super user level 1.\nIn this update package, I do not like Swarm with these functions:\n- No mayor function.\n- No Badge function.\n- No good connection between Swarm (now) and Foursquare (old).\n- No support for Venue for business.\n\nIn my opinion, you should keep Foursquare with old functions and improve it on future. Not replacing Foursquare with strange function of Swarm.\n\nThanks,\nVinh Tran.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=870161082&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
